# ============================================================
# MarketMind AI - Environment Configuration Template
# ============================================================
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# NEVER commit your .env file to source control.
#
# ⚠️  VITE CLIENT-SIDE SECURITY NOTE:
# Vite exposes all VITE_* environment variables in the
# compiled JavaScript bundle that is sent to the browser.
# This means VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY will be visible in the
# browser's DevTools and in your built output files.
#
# For production, restrict your API key's allowed referrers
# in Google AI Studio (https://aistudio.google.com) to your
# deployment domain only, so the key cannot be misused if
# discovered in the client-side bundle.
#
# For a fully secure setup, proxy Gemini calls through a
# server-side backend (e.g. Firebase Functions, Next.js API
# routes) that keeps the key out of the browser entirely.
# ============================================================

# Google Gemini API Key
# Get yours at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# Leave empty or unset to run MarketMind AI in Demo Mode
# (full deterministic functionality, no Gemini AI content)
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here